        "loc_yu_tian",
        "loc_cao_fu_region"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At Tian Chuan heroes assembly, Ma tribe suppresses Cheng tribe to become the alliance leader.",
      "chapters": [
        520
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "alliance-army",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cheng tribe is subjugated by Ma tribe during heroes assembly and becomes the second most influential force in Ma tribe’s army; Cheng Hu is named as a rank four transformation path Gu Master from Cheng tribe.",
      "chapters": [
        523
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "alliance-army",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_cheng_hu",
        "sys_gu_master"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When the opposing army first fields a rank five expert, Ma tribe answers by sending Cheng tribe leader Cheng Long, a rank five transformation path expert and Cheng Hu’s big brother. Ma tribe gains from defeating Ye Lui tribe include Cheng tribe among other large tribes.",
      "chapters": [
        539
      ],
